;\">전기차</span></div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 3px; color: #374151; font-size: 14px; word-break: keep-all;\">→ 애프터마켓 일부 2차전지/ 전기차 테마 하락. 장 마감 후 782,122주(발행주식총수 대비 1.25%) 규모 전환청구권 행사 및 2,541,893주 추가상장(국내사모 CB전환) 공시</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #111827;\">▶ <span style=\"color: #2563eb;\">명신산업</span> <span style=\"color: #2563eb; margin-left: 3px;\">-1.52%</span><span style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 3px; margin-left: 5px; vertical-align: middle;\">자동차부품</span></div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 3px; color: #374151; font-size: 14px; word-break: keep-all;\">→ 애프터마켓 일부 전기차 테마 하락</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #111827;\">▶ <span style=\"color: #2563eb;\">아스플로</span> <span style=\"color: #2563eb; margin-left: 3px;\">-1.42%</span><span style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 3px; margin-left: 5px; vertical-align: middle;\">반도체 장비</span></div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 3px; color: #374151; font-size: 14px; word-break: keep-all;\">→ 애프터마켓 일부 반도체 관련주 하락</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #111827;\">▶ <span style=\"color: #2563eb;\">에스엠벡셀</span> <span style=\"color: #2563eb; margin-left: 3px;\">-1.14%</span><span style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 3px; margin-left: 5px; vertical-align: middle;\">자동차부품</span></div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 3px; color: #374151; font-size: 14px; word-break: keep-all;\">→ 애프터마켓 일부 2차전지/ 전력저장장치(ESS) 테마 하락</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #111827;\">▶ <span style=\"color: #2563eb;\">에스티팜</span> <span style=\"color: #2563eb; margin-left: 3px;\">-1.04%</span><span style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 3px; margin-left: 5px; vertical-align: middle;\">밸류업(25년 기업가치 제고계획 발표)</span></div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 3px; color: #374151; font-size: 14px; word-break: keep-all;\">→ 3분기 영업이익 컨센서스 하회 분석 등에 정규장 하락</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #111827;\">▶ <span style=\"color: #2563eb;\">고려아연</span> <span style=\"color: #2563eb; margin-left: 3px;\">-1.01%</span><span style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 3px; margin-left: 5px; vertical-align: middle;\">귀금속(금/은)</span></div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 3px; color: #374151; font-size: 14px; word-break: keep-all;\">→ [고려아연 지분 콜옵션 공방 ‘배임 논란’으로 확산…영풍 “풋옵션으로 원금 회수 가능” 반박] 기사</div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
